@startuml F3.6-D02-parecer-documento
title F3.6-D02 — Emitir parecer em documento
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "InternshipController" as Ctrl
participant "ReviewDocumentUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Emitir parecer
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /estagios/{id}/documentos/{docId}/parecer
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE documento\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: ok + _links
note right of Ctrl
  _links.arquivar se todos
  obrigatórios APROVADO
end note
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Prof: documento atualizado

@enduml
